{
  "id": "mg-gull-rock",
  "version": 1,
  "engine_version": 1,
  "title": "The Keeper of Gull Rock",
  "one_line_rule": "A storm, a dark lighthouse and a lost boat.",
  "formula": "microgame",
  "brief": {
    "intent": "A storm, a dark lighthouse and a lost boat.",
    "audience": "everyone",
    "mood": [
      "playful"
    ],
    "energy": "medium",
    "competition": "friendly"
  },
  "structure": {
    "cadence": "endless",
    "scope": "everyone",
    "setter": "ai"
  },
  "lineage": {
    "parent": null,
    "operators": [],
    "remix_of": null
  },
  "chain": null,
  "style": {
    "look": "glow",
    "palette": "custom",
    "colors": {
      "bg_top": "#14123A",
      "bg_bottom": "#14123A",
      "ink": "#FFFFFF",
      "primary": "#F7C59F",
      "secondary": "#3E7CB1",
      "accent": "#FBF7EE",
      "danger": "#FF6B6B"
    },
    "font": "rounded",
    "motif": "none",
    "emoji": "🪨",
    "mood_preset": "playful"
  },
  "concepts": [
    {
      "use": "space.microgame"
    },
    {
      "use": "input.microgame"
    },
    {
      "use": "score.microgame",
      "params": {
        "label": "points"
      }
    }
  ],
  "glue": {},
  "content": {
    "game": {
      "format": "microgame/0.2",
      "meta": {
        "title": "The Keeper of Gull Rock",
        "instructions": "A storm, a dark lighthouse and a lost boat. Read each page, then tap a choice (or press 1 and 2). Tap the page to show it all at once. Watch your lamp oil.",
        "duration_s": 120
      },
      "assets": {
        "theme": {
          "sound": "data:audio/wav;base64,"
        },
        "tower": {
          "svg": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 120 220' width='120' height='220'><path d='M42 60 L78 60 L92 210 L28 210 Z' fill='#E9E4D8'/><path d='M38 100 L82 100 L84 120 L36 120 Z M33 150 L87 150 L89 170 L31 170 Z' fill='#C0392B'/><rect x='38' y='40' width='44' height='22' rx='3' fill='#2C3E50'/><rect x='44' y='44' width='32' height='14' rx='2' fill='#FFE29A'/><path d='M34 40 L60 18 L86 40 Z' fill='#C0392B'/><rect x='52' y='186' width='16' height='24' rx='3' fill='#5D4037'/></svg>",
          "w": 120,
          "h": 220
        },
        "boat": {
          "svg": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 60 40' width='60' height='40'><path d='M4 26 L56 26 L48 38 L12 38 Z' fill='#8D6E63'/><rect x='28' y='4' width='3' height='22' fill='#5D4037'/><path d='M31 6 L50 22 L31 22 Z' fill='#ECEFF1'/><circle cx='29' cy='4' r='3' fill='#7CFC8A'/></svg>",
          "w": 60,
          "h": 40
        }
      },
      "types": {
        "Choice": {
          "label": "string",
          "to": "int",
          "oil": "int"
        },
        "Page": {
          "text": "string",
          "mood": "string",
          "ending": "string",
          "choices": "list<Choice>"
        }
      },
      "state": {
        "book": {
          "type": "list<Page>",
          "init": "[{text: 'The storm reached Gull Rock at dusk. Far out on the black water, a small boat blinks a weak green light. The great lamp above you is dark.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Climb to the lamp room', to: 1, oil: 0}, {label: 'Signal with your hand lantern (1 oil)', to: 2, oil: -1}]}, {text: 'Ninety-nine steps. Wind howls through a cracked pane. The wick of the great lamp is dry, and the oil can beside it is nearly empty.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Pour in the last oil (2 oil)', to: 3, oil: -2}, {label: 'Go down to the cellar for more', to: 4, oil: 0}]}, {text: 'Your little lantern swings in wide arcs. The green light turns toward you, and toward the rocks below the cliff.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Wave them north, away from the rocks', to: 5, oil: 0}, {label: 'Run up to the lamp room', to: 1, oil: 0}]}, {text: 'The great lamp roars to life and its beam sweeps the bay. But the flame already sputters. It won’t last the night.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Turn the lens slowly to save fuel', to: 6, oil: 0}, {label: 'Keep it blazing at full', to: 7, oil: 0}]}, {text: 'The cellar is flooding. Two casks bob in the dark water: one painted with a red stripe, one with no mark at all.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Take the red-striped cask (+3 oil)', to: 8, oil: 3}, {label: 'Take the unmarked cask', to: 9, oil: 0}]}, {text: 'The boat swings north, clear of the rocks, but now it drifts toward open sea. Without the great lamp they will never find the harbor.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Climb to the lamp room', to: 1, oil: 0}, {label: 'Row out to guide them yourself', to: 10, oil: 0}]}, {text: 'The slow beam pulses like a heartbeat. Through the rain you see oars rise and fall, steady now, pulling toward your dock.', mood: 'calm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Keep watch until morning', to: 11, oil: 0}]}, {text: 'For one glorious minute the whole bay is bright as noon. Then the flame gutters and dies, and the dark rushes back.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Hurry down to the cellar', to: 4, oil: 0}, {label: 'Light your hand lantern (1 oil)', to: 2, oil: -1}]}, {text: 'You haul the cask up ninety-nine steps, soaked and shaking. It sloshes, heavy and full. Enough oil for the whole night.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Light the great lamp (2 oil)', to: 6, oil: -2}]}, {text: 'It’s sea water, not oil. The wick hisses and drowns. Somewhere below, the cellar door slams in the wind.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'none', choices: [{label: 'Back down to the cellar', to: 4, oil: 0}]}, {text: 'Your rowboat climbs a wave taller than the lighthouse door. For a moment the green light is close enough to touch. Then the sea takes your oars.', mood: 'storm', ending: 'adrift', choices: []}, {text: 'Dawn breaks pink over Gull Rock. The little boat is tied to your dock, and a family in borrowed blankets waves up at your window.', mood: 'dawn', ending: 'dawn', choices: []}]"
        },
        "page": {
          "type": "int",
          "init": "0"
        },
        "oil": {
          "type": "int",
          "init": "2"
        },
        "shown_at": {
          "type": "int",
          "init": "0"
        },
        "steps_taken": {
          "type": "int",
          "init": "0"
        },
        "mood": {
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "calm",
              "storm",
              "dawn"
            ]
          },
          "init": "'storm'"
        },
        "ending": {
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "none",
              "dawn",
              "adrift"
            ]
          },
          "init": "'none'"
        }
      },
      "functions": {
        "wrap": {
          "params": {
            "text": "string",
            "n": "int"
          },
          "returns": "list<string>",
          "body": "fold(split(text, ' '), [], (lines, w) => if len(lines) > 0 and len(last(lines)) + 1 + len(w) <= n then set_at(lines, len(lines) - 1, last(lines) + ' ' + w) else push(lines, w))"
        },
        "reveal_ms": {
          "params": {
            "text": "string"
          },
          "returns": "int",
          "body": "len(text) * 28"
        },
        "affordable": {
          "params": {
            "c": "Choice",
            "fuel": "int"
          },
          "returns": "bool",
          "body": "fuel + c.oil >= 0"
        }
      },
      "events": {
        "turned": {
          "to": "int"
        },
        "finish": {},
        "broke": {}
      },
      "inputs": {
        "choose": {
          "payload": {
            "i": "int"
          },
          "when": "ending == 'none'",
          "from": [
            {
              "key": "Digit1",
              "with": {
                "i": "0"
              }
            },
            {
              "key": "Digit2",
              "with": {
                "i": "1"
              }
            },
            {
              "key": "Numpad1",
              "with": {
                "i": "0"
              }
            },
            {
              "key": "Numpad2",
              "with": {
                "i": "1"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "skip": {
          "payload": {},
          "from": [
            {
              "key": "Space"
            },
            {
              "key": "Enter"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "rules": [
        {
          "id": "skip",
          "on": "skip",
          "do": [
            {
              "set": "shown_at",
              "to": "min(shown_at, now - reveal_ms(book[page].text))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choose",
          "on": "choose",
          "when": "now - shown_at >= reveal_ms(book[page].text) and event.i < len(book[page].choices) and affordable(book[page].choices[event.i], oil)",
          "do": [
            {
              "let": {
                "c": "book[page].choices[event.i]"
              }
            },
            {
              "incr": "oil",
              "by": "c.oil"
            },
            {
              "set": "page",
              "to": "c.to"
            },
            {
              "set": "shown_at",
              "to": "now"
            },
            {
              "incr": "steps_taken"
            },
            {
              "let": {
                "p": "book[c.to]"
              }
            },
            {
              "set": "mood",
              "to": "if p.mood == 'dawn' then 'dawn' else if p.mood == 'calm' then 'calm' else 'storm'"
            },
            {
              "emit": "turned",
              "with": {
                "to": "c.to"
              }
            },
            {
              "if": "p.ending != 'none'",
              "then": [
                {
                  "set": "ending",
                  "to": "if p.ending == 'dawn' then 'dawn' else 'adrift'"
                },
                {
                  "after": "reveal_ms(p.text) + 2500",
                  "emit": "finish"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cant_afford",
          "on": "choose",
          "when": "now - shown_at >= reveal_ms(book[page].text) and event.i < len(book[page].choices) and not affordable(book[page].choices[event.i], oil)",
          "do": [
            {
              "emit": "broke"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "finish",
          "on": "finish",
          "do": [
            {
              "if": "ending == 'dawn'",
              "then": [
                {
                  "end": "win"
                }
              ],
              "else": [
                {
                  "end": "lose"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "objectives": {
        "score": "if ending == 'dawn' then max(100, 1000 - steps_taken * 60 + oil * 50) else steps_taken * 10",
        "time_limit": "180s",
        "on_timeout": "lose"
      },
      "presentation": {
        "canvas": {
          "w": 360,
          "h": 640,
          "background": "= if mood == 'dawn' then $dawn_bg else if mood == 'calm' then $calm_bg else $storm_bg"
        },
        "music": {
          "asset": "theme",
          "volume": 0.35,
          "playing": "= status == 'playing' and mood != 'dawn'"
        },
        "tokens": {
          "storm_bg": "#101828",
          "calm_bg": "#1B2B44",
          "dawn_bg": "#F7C59F",
          "sea": "#0B3954",
          "sea_dawn": "#3E7CB1",
          "paper": "#FBF7EE",
          "ink": "#2B2118",
          "faded": "#9C8F80",
          "card": "#FFFFFF",
          "card_off": "#E3DED4",
          "accent": "#C0392B",
          "oil": "#F4A259",
          "rain": "#9FB4D9"
        },
        "root": {
          "node": "group",
          "children": [
            {
              "node": "repeat",
              "source": "range(24)",
              "as": "i",
              "template": {
                "node": "line",
                "visible": "= mood == 'storm'",
                "x": "= fmod(hash(i) * 400 + now * 0.05, 400.0) - 20",
                "y": "= fmod(hash(i + 50) * 260 + now * 0.6, 260.0) - 20",
                "x1": 0,
                "y1": 0,
                "x2": -6,
                "y2": 18,
                "stroke": "$rain",
                "stroke_width": 1.5,
                "opacity": 0.5
              }
            },
            {
              "node": "image",
              "asset": "tower",
              "x": 222,
              "y": 20,
              "w": 96,
              "h": 176
            },
            {
              "node": "poly",
              "visible": "= mood != 'dawn' and page != 0 and page != 2 and page != 4 and page != 9",
              "x": 270,
              "y": 56,
              "fill": "#FFE29A",
              "opacity": "= 0.18 + 0.1 * sin(now / 300)",
              "points": "= let a = sin(now / 900) * 0.6 in [vec(0.0, 0.0), vec(-260 * cos(a), -40 + 260 * sin(a)), vec(-260 * cos(a), 40 + 260 * sin(a))]"
            },
            {
              "node": "poly",
              "fill": "= if mood == 'dawn' then $sea_dawn else $sea",
              "points": "= concat(map(range(13), i => vec(i * 30.0, 196 + 6 * sin(now / 400 + i * 0.9))), [vec(360.0, 260.0), vec(0.0, 260.0)])"
            },
            {
              "node": "image",
              "asset": "boat",
              "x": "= if ending == 'dawn' then 180 else 40 + 20 * sin(now / 1300)",
              "y": "= 172 + 4 * sin(now / 350)",
              "rotation": "= 6 * sin(now / 500)",
              "transition": {
                "x": {
                  "ms": 1500,
                  "ease": "out"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "node": "rect",
              "x": 16,
              "y": 248,
              "w": 328,
              "h": 376,
              "radius": 16,
              "fill": "$paper",
              "on_tap": {
                "input": "skip",
                "with": {}
              }
            },
            {
              "node": "text",
              "x": 32,
              "y": 262,
              "text": "= 'Page ' + str(steps_taken + 1)",
              "size": 13,
              "weight": 600,
              "color": "$faded"
            },
            {
              "node": "text",
              "x": 228,
              "y": 262,
              "align": "right",
              "w": 100,
              "text": "= 'Oil ' + str(oil)",
              "size": 13,
              "weight": 700,
              "color": "$oil",
              "animate_on": {
                "broke": {
                  "prop": "scale",
                  "keys": [
                    1,
                    1.4,
                    1
                  ],
                  "ms": 300
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "node": "repeat",
              "source": "wrap(book[page].text, 28)",
              "as": "line",
              "template": {
                "node": "text",
                "x": 32,
                "y": "= 288 + index * 24",
                "size": 17,
                "color": "$ink",
                "text": "= let before = sum(map(take(wrap(book[page].text, 28), index), l => len(l) + 1)) in let shown = floor((now - shown_at) / 28) - before in if shown <= 0 then '' else substr(line, 0, shown)"
              }
            },
            {
              "node": "repeat",
              "source": "book[page].choices",
              "as": "c",
              "template": {
                "node": "group",
                "visible": "= now - shown_at >= reveal_ms(book[page].text)",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "node": "rect",
                    "x": 28,
                    "y": "= 500 + index * 56",
                    "w": 304,
                    "h": 46,
                    "radius": 12,
                    "fill": "= if affordable(c, oil) then $card else $card_off",
                    "stroke": "$accent",
                    "stroke_width": "= if affordable(c, oil) then 2 else 0",
                    "on_tap": {
                      "input": "choose",
                      "with": {
                        "i": "index"
                      }
                    },
                    "animate_on": {
                      "choose": {
                        "when": "event.i == index",
                        "prop": "scale",
                        "keys": [
                          1,
                          0.95,
                          1
                        ],
                        "ms": 140
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "node": "text",
                    "x": 44,
                    "y": "= 500 + index * 56",
                    "w": 280,
                    "h": 46,
                    "valign": "middle",
                    "align": "left",
                    "wrap": true,
                    "text": "= str(index + 1) + '.  ' + c.label",
                    "size": 15,
                    "weight": 600,
                    "color": "= if affordable(c, oil) then $ink else $faded"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "node": "text",
              "x": 180,
              "y": 580,
              "anchor": "center",
              "visible": "= ending != 'none' and now - shown_at >= reveal_ms(book[page].text)",
              "text": "= if ending == 'dawn' then 'THE END' else 'LOST AT SEA'",
              "size": 22,
              "weight": 800,
              "color": "$accent"
            }
          ]
        },
        "feedback": [
          {
            "on": "turned",
            "do": [
              {
                "sound": {
                  "wave": "sine",
                  "notes": [
                    "A4",
                    "E5"
                  ],
                  "step_ms": 70,
                  "volume": 0.3
                }
              },
              {
                "haptic": "light"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "on": "broke",
            "do": [
              {
                "toast": {
                  "text": "Not enough oil",
                  "ms": 1200
                }
              },
              {
                "haptic": "warning"
              },
              {
                "sound": {
                  "wave": "square",
                  "note": "C3",
                  "ms": 120,
                  "volume": 0.25
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "on": "win",
            "do": [
              {
                "sound": {
                  "wave": "triangle",
                  "notes": [
                    "C5",
                    "E5",
                    "G5",
                    "C6"
                  ],
                  "step_ms": 160,
                  "volume": 0.5
                }
              },
              {
                "haptic": "success"
              },
              {
                "particles": {
                  "x": 270,
                  "y": 60,
                  "count": 40,
                  "color": "#FFE29A",
                  "speed": 160,
                  "ms": 1400,
                  "spread": 180
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "on": "lose",
            "do": [
              {
                "sound": {
                  "wave": "sine",
                  "notes": [
                    "E4",
                    "D4",
                    "B3",
                    "A3"
                  ],
                  "step_ms": 220,
                  "volume": 0.4
                }
              },
              {
                "haptic": "heavy"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "seed": 1007,
  "_seed": {
    "creator_id": "sf-priya-natarajan",
    "created_hours_ago": 48,
    "play_count": 287,
    "like_count": 90,
    "save_count": 108
  }
}
